    "title": "Kodak Shootout Set to Benefit Abused Kids in Five Counties - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Evans ,\n13 hours ago Registration is open for the 11th Annual Dixie Roofing Clays for Children Sporting Clays Tournament, a two-day sporting clays competition set for Oct. 1-2 at Iron Mountain Sporting Clays in Kodak. The event benefits Children's Centers serving Campbell, Claiborne, Fentress, Scott and Union counties, which provide medical exams, forensic interviews, counseling and court support for abused and neglected children across the five-county region. Read full article",
